@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 55
left to right direction

Class Person
Class Name
Class Phone
Class Email
Class Address
Enum "<<enumeration>>\nStatus" as Status
Class FollowUp
Class LastContact
Class Tag
Class InteractionNote

Person *-up-> "1" Name
Person *-up-> "1" Phone
Person *-up-> "1" Email
Person *-up-> "1" Address

Person -down-> "1" Status
Person *-down-> "0..1" FollowUp
Person *-down-> "0..1" LastContact
Person *-down-> "*" Tag
Person *-down-> "*" InteractionNote
@enduml
